{"name":"Awakening","hex":"#bb9e9b","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"awakening","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Rousing from sleep, in a natural or a figurative sense; rousing into activity; exciting"]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The act of awaking, or ceasing to sleep.","A revival of religion, or more general attention to religious matters than usual."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/awakening"}],"entries":[{"title":"Wakefulness","blocks":[{"text":"Wakefulness is a daily recurring brain state in which an individual is conscious and engages in coherent cognitive and behavioural responses to the external world."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wakefulness"},{"title":"Awakening (Finnish religious movement)","blocks":[{"text":"The Awakening is a Lutheran religious movement in Finland which has found followers in the provinces of Savo and Ostrobothnia. The origins of the movement are in the 18th century. It has functioned inside the Evangelical Lutheran Church of Finland throughout its existence. Formerly very Pietist, the movement is currently considered within mainstream Finnish Lutheranism."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Herattajajuhlat_seinajoki_2009.JPG/330px-Herattajajuhlat_seinajoki_2009.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Awakening_(Finnish_religious_movement)"},{"title":"Awakening (video game series)","blocks":[{"text":"Awakening is a casual hidden object puzzle adventure game series developed by Boomzap Entertainment and published by Big Fish Games. In order to progress through each game, the player must solve puzzles and find hidden objects. It is available on PC, Mac, iPhone and iPad platforms. The games are released in several languages with both Standard Editions and Collector's Editions, the latter including additional features."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/7/71/Awakening_The_Redleaf_Forest_logo%2C_by_Boomzap_Entertainment.png/330px-Awakening_The_Redleaf_Forest_logo%2C_by_Boomzap_Entertainment.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Awakening_(video_game_series)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Paavo_Ruotsalainen.jpg/250px-Paavo_Ruotsalainen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9a/Paavo_Ruotsalainen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Paavo_Ruotsalainen.jpg/250px-Paavo_Ruotsalainen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Paavo Ruotsalainen (1777–1852).","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APaavo_Ruotsalainen.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/N._K._Malmberg.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/N._K._Malmberg.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"Nils Gustav Malmberg (1807-1858)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AN._K._Malmberg.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Wilhelmi_Malmivaara.jpg/500px-Wilhelmi_Malmivaara.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Wilhelmi_Malmivaara.jpg/1280px-Wilhelmi_Malmivaara.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Wilhelmi_Malmivaara.jpg/500px-Wilhelmi_Malmivaara.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Wilhelmi Malmivaara, the founder of th